sensitive an analysis is to its bound rather than as the bound itself. An
\code{upper} below 0.5 is refused rather than read as the other tail: write
\code{upper = 0.9} to bound the upper tail at the 0.9 quantile, or
\code{lower = 0.1} to bound the lower tail at the 0.1 quantile.

